tip: | Look at the face. | Two ears, two eyes and a nose. That is few pixels, and each one has a job, so nothing here is decoration.
tip: 1 | The shape says cat first. | Before any feature, the wide head and two points already say cat. If this stage reads as a blob, a face will not save it.
tip: | Try it. | With the Pencil, move one black pupil a pixel to the side. Now the cat is looking at something. Features this small are all expression. | pencil
